<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49918" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδνόομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bend oneself,
				double oneself up</i>, esp. for pain, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδνώθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.266
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδνώθη δὲ πεσών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.618
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδνωθεὶς ὀπίσω</span>, of a
			snake in the clutches of an eagle, <i><span class="en">
				12.205
			</span></i>; also, of one throwing up a ball perpendicularly, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.375
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.97
			</span></i>; of the womb, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν . . ἰδνωθῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδνοῦται</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰδνῶ</span></b>  only in
				Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.451
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
